  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1407.02 Numbering",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1407.02 Numbering. The operator of any carnival or amusement ride that is composed of individual carriers, or designee, shall number each unit of the carnival or amusement ride to enable identification of each separate carrier unit. The numbers shall be at least 2 inches in height and shall be placed where they shall remain legible.\n\nSource. #8045, eff 2-20-04 (formerly Saf-C 1407.01); ss by #8342, eff 4-28-05, EXPIRED: 1-2-14 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1400)\n\nNew. #10507, eff 1-21-14; EXPIRED: 1-21-24\n\nNew. #13984, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 5-24-24, EXPIRED: 11-20-24\n\nNew. #14139, eff 11-28-24, EXPIRES: 11-28-34 (see Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1400)",
